1
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:06,215
Two boys, born two years apart, in two corners of the world.

2
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:13,315
In Rosario, Argentina, Lionel Messi was born in 1987.

3
00:00:13,515 --> 00:00:16,255
In Funchal, on the Portuguese island of Madeira,

4
00:00:16,305 --> 00:00:19,921
Cristiano Ronaldo was born in 1985.

5
00:00:20,671 --> 00:00:23,071
As a small boy, Lionel played in the streets,

6
00:00:23,121 --> 00:00:25,533
with his family, and for his local club.

7
00:00:25,733 --> 00:00:27,853
Cristiano grew up in a modest home,

8
00:00:27,903 --> 00:00:29,333
in a family with little money,

9
00:00:29,383 --> 00:00:31,881
playing in the streets and for a local club.

10
00:00:32,631 --> 00:00:34,211
At about ten or eleven,

11
00:00:34,261 --> 00:00:37,251
Lionel was diagnosed with a growth hormone deficiency.

12
00:00:37,541 --> 00:00:39,342
The treatment was costly.

13
00:00:39,542 --> 00:00:43,122
At twelve, Cristiano joined the youth academy of Sporting CP,

14
00:00:43,172 --> 00:00:44,930
and left home.

15
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:46,980
In 2000, at thirteen,

16
00:00:47,030 --> 00:00:50,720
FC Barcelona offered to cover his treatment.

17
00:00:50,830 --> 00:00:53,713
He left his country for Spain, with his father.

18
00:00:53,913 --> 00:00:55,473
That same year, at fifteen,

19
00:00:55,523 --> 00:00:58,333
Cristiano had surgery for a racing heart condition.

20
00:00:58,523 --> 00:01:00,402
Then he returned to the pitch.

21
00:01:01,652 --> 00:01:03,972
Different homes. Different challenges.

22
00:01:04,102 --> 00:01:06,096
The same ball at their feet.

23
00:01:06,947 --> 00:01:09,763
As the boys grew, their roads drew closer.

24
00:01:11,013 --> 00:01:13,748
Both became the greatest players of their generation.

25
00:01:17,452 --> 00:01:19,861
Same game. Different roads.

